---@field excludeStatusCodes? vercel.projects.DeleteProjectAvatarResponseRollingReleaseGateChecksItemExcludeStatusCodesList Response status codes to ignore entirely — dropped from both the numerator (errors) and the denominator (total requests). Defaults to `[]` when omitted.
