---@field freeProjectForLegacyLimits? boolean Whether the project was part of the legacy limits for hobby and pro-trial before billing was added. This field is only set when the team is upgraded to a paid plan and we are backfilling the subscription status. We cap the subscription to 2 projects and set this field for the 3rd project. When this field is set, the project is not charged for and we do not call any billing APIs for this project.
