---@class vercel.projects.UploadProjectAvatarResponseProtectionBypassValueCase1
---@field createdAt number
---@field createdBy string
---@field isEnvVar? boolean When there was only one bypass, it was automatically set as an env var on deployments. With multiple bypasses, there is always one bypass that is selected as the default, and gets set as an env var on deployments. As this is a new field, undefined means that the bypass is the env var. If there are any automation bypasses, exactly one must be the env var.
---@field note? string Optional note about the bypass to be displayed in the UI
